  "foaf:name": "Proyecto Acuática: Guardianes del Mar Caribe",
  "sdo:name": "Proyecto Acuática: Guardianes del Mar Caribe",
  "sdo:description": "Proyecto Acuática is a youth-led marine education and ocean culture initiative based in Barranquilla, Colombia. It empowers new generations through culturally-rooted ocean literacy, artistic communication, and participatory education. The project collects and brings to life the invisible heritage of the sea such as stories, traditions, and local ways of doing things through creative learning, sharing between generations, and storytelling. It builds connections between young people, teachers, fishers, and scientists across the Colombian Caribbean. It contributes to Ocean Decade Challenges 1, 2, 5, 9, and 10 by advancing community-led ocean literacy, cultural resilience, and sustainable stewardship.",
